WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,420 --> 00:00:08,620
You are Lin Mo. Please report to the headquarters that Lin Mo was found unharmed.

2
00:00:10,380 --> 00:00:12,020
Jinchi Jianpeng suddenly rioted last night

3
00:00:12,340 --> 00:00:13,740
Sixteen people have been killed so far

4
00:00:13,940 --> 00:00:14,940
Nearly a hundred people were seriously injured

5
00:00:15,340 --> 00:00:16,500
You are so close to his studies

6
00:00:16,740 --> 00:00:17,740
Surprisingly safe and sound

7
00:00:18,020 --> 00:00:19,020
simply a miracle

8
00:00:19,420 --> 00:00:20,820
You're so lucky

9
00:00:21,220 --> 00:00:27,500
Maybe I'm lucky. Where is your locator?

10
00:00:27,660 --> 00:00:29,100
Didn't I tell you that you must keep it?

11
00:00:29,260 --> 00:00:30,940
It was too chaotic when encountering Jinchi Jianpeng

12
00:00:31,220 --> 00:00:33,910
I accidentally lost you while escaping.

13
00:00:34,030 --> 00:00:34,950
I have no time to pursue it now

14
00:00:35,150 --> 00:00:43,510
From now on, stay in the assembly camp and you are not allowed to leave without permission.

15
00:00:43,910 --> 00:00:45,110
I can use this time

16
00:00:45,550 --> 00:00:47,190
I contracted Jinchi Jianpeng first.
